5. For the purposes of section 250E(1)(e) of the Act, the statement of affairs of the company that must be provided to the nominated liquidator under section 250D(5)(b) of the Act must also contain the following information (as applicable):
(a)the cause or causes of insolvency;
(b)the name and address of each debtor of the company;
(c)the NRIC or passport number or Unique Entity Number (UEN) of each debtor or creditor of the company;
(d)for each creditor of the company — whether the creditor is a contingent or prospective creditor or otherwise.
[S 25/2026 wef 29/01/2026]
